    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyo Rwoth nyithindho makayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kethi ran gicen nyithindho makayo, kole kisi okayo pa Joisiraili kodi apa ogwaŋe jobedo aparan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalima ma Mugat ma buthow",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Musa owaco ri ji ni, “Poyi win ndelo ma wiwok'iye i Misir kam'oyido wibedo ŋecin. Me ndelo ma Rwoth owodho win gi meni pere madwoŋ. Wikiripi camo mugat m'otimi gi thow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiwok i Misir i ndelo me, i dwe mar'acel, dwe ma Abib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka Rwoth okeli win i lowo pa Jokanan, Johiti, Joamor, Johivi, kodi Joyebus, lowo ma mol gi cak kodi mo kic, ma go ociko kwarere mewin nike bino miyo win, wiripo timo kalima me i dwe mar'acel kisi oro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ndelo abirio wiripo camo mugat ma buthow, aka i ndelo mar'abirio wobedi kalima ma miyo Rwoth dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ndelo abirio wikiripi camo mugat m'otimi gi thow, aka wongoye thow kosa mugat m'otimi gi thow ma wonwaŋere iy'adec mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wititi ri wot win i ndelo no nike witimo gime kwoŋbedo gima Rwoth otimo riwin munyo wiwok i Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalima me bino bedo rapoy, paka gim'otwey i cingi win kosa ruwaŋ win, bino poyo win medo waco cik pa Rwoth, kwoŋbedo Rwoth owodho win wok i Misir gi meni pere madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno wiripo timo kalima me i hongo mere kisi oro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyathi makayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aka ka Rwoth okeli win i lowo pa Jokanan, paka okwoŋere ri kwarere mewin to miyo win, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.19+EXO.34.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 34:19-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wiripo miyo go okayin mewin kodi apa ogwaŋe. Kisi okayo mewin kodi apa ogwaŋe jobedo apa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wiripo wilo okayin pa punde mewin gi nyithindhi rombo ma cwo wok bongi Rwoth. Ka wikimiti wilo, tur win ŋuti gin. Wiripo bende nyewo okayin mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Comoro ka wot win jopenji win gima gime nyutho, dwoki win nike, gi meni madwoŋ Rwoth owodho wan wok i Misir kam'oyido wabedo ŋecin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Farawo okwero weyo wan kadho, Rwoth oneko kisi okayo i Misir, apa ji kiri g'ogwaŋe. Am'omiyo wamiyo Rwoth okayin mawan kiri gi apa ogwaŋe. To okayin mawan wanyewo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gime bino bedo rapoy, paka gim'otwey i cingi wan kosa ruwaŋ wan, bino poyo wan nike Rwoth owodho wan wok i Misir gi meni pere madwoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siro ma Pondeponde gi Siro ma mac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo Farawo oweyo Joisiraili kadho, Were k'otelo jo luwo gi yo ma kidho kiri i thengi Filistia makada nende oyido cek. Kole Were owaco ni, “Ji jonyalo wiro paro pajo gik i Misir ka joneni nike jokidho bedo gi lweny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Were otelo jo luwo gi thim ma Nam M'obokere. Aka Joisiraili oyido joyikere lwenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
